```py
transfer(frm, to, amnt)
assert amnt>100 and amnt>0, '@@@ transfer amount is not greater than 100 and is positive'
```

Please note that 'amnt' should be the amount that you want to transfer. I put '100' in this example just to complete the condition in the assert statement.
